@*
    KVKK (docs/03_PageBlueprints.md "Page — KVKK"). Title/description/
    canonical/OG/WebPage schema come from ViewData["Seo"] +
    ViewData["SeoPageType"], set in KvkkController.Index via ISeoService —
    see _Layout.cshtml's <head> and SeoStructuredDataViewComponent.

    Page flow: Breadcrumb → plain page heading (same text/subheading Hero
    Banner previously rendered, now a plain heading section styled like HR
    Policy's own page title — see site.css) → KVKK Policy (Introduction +
    Privacy Policy folded into one document, KvkkPolicyViewComponent — see
    that component's comment for why) → Contact Information (Information
    Card List layout reusing SiteSettings, KvkkContactViewComponent).
    Accordion and Download Button are explicitly out of scope (project
    owner's 2026-08-03 approval). Footer / CTA Banner / Floating Contact
    Button are already global (_Layout.cshtml).

    2026-08-17 correction: HeroBannerStandard (and its background image)
    removed outright, not replaced — same "no Hero Banner, plain page
    heading" pattern About/Values/Career/Contact/HR Policy already use.
    The heading and subheading text themselves are unchanged from what the
    Hero Banner rendered.
*@

@using System.Globalization
@{
    // KVKK itself is the Turkish data-protection law's own name — not
    // translated, same as a reference to "GDPR" wouldn't be (rule: legal/
    // regulatory identifiers stay as-is). Only the surrounding copy and
    // the page's own privacy content (KvkkPolicyViewComponent) are
    // localized.
    var isEn = CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture.TwoLetterISOLanguageName.Equals("en", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase);

    var breadcrumbTrail = new List<AncinInsaat.ViewComponents.BreadcrumbItem>
    {
        new() { Label = isEn ? "KVKK Privacy Notice" : "KVKK Aydınlatma Metni" }
    };
}
@await Component.InvokeAsync("Breadcrumb", new { trail = breadcrumbTrail })

<section class="section kvkk-heading-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 id="kvkk-heading" class="kvkk-heading">@(isEn ? "KVKK Privacy Notice" : "KVKK Aydınlatma Metni")</h1>
        <p class="kvkk-subheading">@(isEn ? "Our notice on the processing of your personal data." : "Kişisel verilerinizin işlenmesine ilişkin aydınlatma metnimiz.")</p>
    </div>
</section>

@await Component.InvokeAsync("KvkkPolicy")

@await Component.InvokeAsync("KvkkContact")
